      "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/be8b1e2f3b245c3b58896292edcac334.poster.avif?t=1771516344\" width=648 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/be8b1e2f3b245c3b58896292edcac334.webm?t=1771516344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/be8b1e2f3b245c3b58896292edcac334.mp4?t=1771516344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>『Mini Cozy Room : Lo-Fi』</strong>is a productivity game that blends calming Lo-Fi music with creative room decoration.<br>Cute avatars and pets, along with convenient desktop tools like memos, to-do lists, and a Pomodoro timer, are designed to boost your focus and efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. Your Own Cozy Workspace</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the workspace you’ve always dreamed of!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a wide variety of rooms, furniture, and decorations.<br>The beautiful workspace you design will help enhance your concentration and productivity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/cf75cbe04dd6ad9d9cae8eddfb539cec.gif?t=1771516344\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/cf75cbe04dd6ad9d9cae8eddfb539cec.poster.avif?t=1771516344\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. Soothing Lo-Fi Music &amp; Ambience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your workspace with diverse Lo-Fi music genres and calming ambient sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll soon find yourself relaxed and deeply immersed in your tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/b2e10ced4d950ce616a239672f12f410.apng?t=1771516344\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/b2e10ced4d950ce616a239672f12f410.poster.avif?t=1771516344\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. Multiplayer Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling lonely while working alone?<br>Work together with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite friends to your workspace, or visit rooms shared by other players.<br>Chat freely with people from around the world using text, emojis, and mini notes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who prefer a quieter environment, a <strong>Focus Mode</strong> is also available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/05a9b344221d87438f2cc7a7f8ff4c0e.avif?t=1771516344\" width=648 height=328 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4. Innovative Desktop UI and Mini Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely reposition and resize notes and to-do lists on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling overwhelmed by the large game screen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch to Mini Mode and conveniently place it in your taskbar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/40158ce8d16bd11b797dfab4ae9340d6.poster.avif?t=1771516344\" width=648 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/40158ce8d16bd11b797dfab4ae9340d6.webm?t=1771516344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/40158ce8d16bd11b797dfab4ae9340d6.mp4?t=1771516344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5. Cute Avatars and Pets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express your unique style with diverse fashion options, hairstyles, and accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move adorable avatars to chairs, beds, or beanbags and assign tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovely pets like cats, dogs, and hedgehogs will keep you company.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>6. Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy Lo-Fi music across various genres</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix different ambient sounds to create your perfect atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use productivity tools such as Memo, To-Do List, and Pomodoro Timer (with both count-up and count-down modes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your own avatar with various hairstyles and outfits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your personal workspace with different wallpapers and furniture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add external music files (MP3, WAV, etc.) to create your own playlist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bookmark your favorite channels using the YouTube embedded player for easy access</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn experience by listening to music. As you level up, gift deliveries arrive in your room</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up to unlock new items and content</p></li></ul>",
      "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/be8b1e2f3b245c3b58896292edcac334.poster.avif?t=1771516344\" width=648 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/be8b1e2f3b245c3b58896292edcac334.webm?t=1771516344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/be8b1e2f3b245c3b58896292edcac334.mp4?t=1771516344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>『Mini Cozy Room : Lo-Fi』</strong>is a productivity game that blends calming Lo-Fi music with creative room decoration.<br>Cute avatars and pets, along with convenient desktop tools like memos, to-do lists, and a Pomodoro timer, are designed to boost your focus and efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. Your Own Cozy Workspace</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the workspace you’ve always dreamed of!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a wide variety of rooms, furniture, and decorations.<br>The beautiful workspace you design will help enhance your concentration and productivity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/cf75cbe04dd6ad9d9cae8eddfb539cec.gif?t=1771516344\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/cf75cbe04dd6ad9d9cae8eddfb539cec.poster.avif?t=1771516344\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. Soothing Lo-Fi Music &amp; Ambience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your workspace with diverse Lo-Fi music genres and calming ambient sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll soon find yourself relaxed and deeply immersed in your tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/b2e10ced4d950ce616a239672f12f410.apng?t=1771516344\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/b2e10ced4d950ce616a239672f12f410.poster.avif?t=1771516344\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. Multiplayer Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling lonely while working alone?<br>Work together with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite friends to your workspace, or visit rooms shared by other players.<br>Chat freely with people from around the world using text, emojis, and mini notes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who prefer a quieter environment, a <strong>Focus Mode</strong> is also available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/05a9b344221d87438f2cc7a7f8ff4c0e.avif?t=1771516344\" width=648 height=328 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4. Innovative Desktop UI and Mini Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely reposition and resize notes and to-do lists on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling overwhelmed by the large game screen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch to Mini Mode and conveniently place it in your taskbar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/40158ce8d16bd11b797dfab4ae9340d6.poster.avif?t=1771516344\" width=648 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/40158ce8d16bd11b797dfab4ae9340d6.webm?t=1771516344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/40158ce8d16bd11b797dfab4ae9340d6.mp4?t=1771516344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5. Cute Avatars and Pets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express your unique style with diverse fashion options, hairstyles, and accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move adorable avatars to chairs, beds, or beanbags and assign tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovely pets like cats, dogs, and hedgehogs will keep you company.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>6. Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy Lo-Fi music across various genres</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix different ambient sounds to create your perfect atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use productivity tools such as Memo, To-Do List, and Pomodoro Timer (with both count-up and count-down modes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your own avatar with various hairstyles and outfits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your personal workspace with different wallpapers and furniture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add external music files (MP3, WAV, etc.) to create your own playlist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bookmark your favorite channels using the YouTube embedded player for easy access</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn experience by listening to music. As you level up, gift deliveries arrive in your room</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up to unlock new items and content</p></li></ul>",
      "short_description": "Create Your Own Cozy Workspace! Mini Cozy Room : Lo-Fi is a productivity game blending relaxing Lo-Fi music with room decoration. Cute avatars, pets, desktop memos, to-do lists, and a Pomodoro timer help boost your focus. Feeling lonely? Work together with friends in multiplayer mode.",
